# SECTION 11 - QUOTATION COMPARISON

PURCHASE_TEAM ONLY
11.1 Get Quotation Comparison
    GET /api/quotations/rfq/:rfqId/comparison
    Authorization: Bearer PURCHASE_TEAM Token
    Expected:
        ✓ RFQ Details Returned
        ✓ Quotations Sorted By totalAmount (Ascending)
        ✓ Rank Assigned Automatically
        ✓ Lowest Quotation Appears At Rank 1

    Example Response
    json
        {
            "success": true,
            "data": {
                "rfqId": "RFQ_ID",
                "rfqNumber": "RFQ-00001",
                "quotations": [
                    {
                        "rank": 1,
                        "quotationId": "QT_ID",
                        "quotationNumber": "QT-00002",
